{"id":"n74105-1-9","stage":1,"title":"들어오다 · 进","scene":"出门与归家","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74105-1-9-1","ko":"엄마, 저 친구 만나러 나갔다 올게요.","zh":"妈妈，我出去见个朋友就回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}},{"text":"만나러","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나러","audio":"/audio/b585438d28c35f618cda.mp3"}},{"text":"나갔다","meaning":"出去","explanation":"나가다：出去；-았다가 与后面的 오다 合用，表示出去做事再回来。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나갔다","audio":"/audio/4474ae87d501bfa3b579.mp3"}},{"text":"올게요.","meaning":"会回来","explanation":"오다：回来；-ㄹ게요 礼貌地向母亲说明自己会回来。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올게요","audio":"/audio/65fee9486bc51beeb1c3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从家里往外走；这里是出去见朋友后再回来。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a9a4b05417716834806e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74105-1-9-2","ko":"집에 너무 늦지 않게 들어오너라.","zh":"回家别太晚。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"回家","explanation":"집：住的家；-에 标记回去的目的地。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"늦지","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦지","audio":"/audio/c015602a793539936328.mp3"}},{"text":"않게","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않게","audio":"/audio/070ef42fea7052c4ede6.mp3"}},{"text":"들어오너라.","meaning":"回来、进家门","explanation":"들어오다：从外面回到家里；-너라 是对亲近的人或晚辈的嘱咐。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어오너라","audio":"/audio/51382c9ffb9787442033.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家、住所","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"居住的房屋或地方；这里是说话人要回去的家。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a381b6c105463283d950.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.487,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74105","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"seq